      ],
      "source": "https://blythechamber.com/about-blythe/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Blythe’s early development hinged on William Calloway’s 1870s surveys and land claims under the Swamp Land Act, securing 140,000 acres for irrigation.",
